# Line endings, settled once.
#
# Git on Windows can rewrite line endings on checkout. Block 7 writes a CSV
# with Windows line endings on purpose — Excel wants them — and keeps expected
# bytes as fixtures. Without this file those fixtures would be rewritten on a
# Windows checkout, and a test could pass on one machine and fail on CI.

# Normalise real source files to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these: their bytes are the thing under test.
*.csv -text
**/__fixtures__/** -text

# Binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
